* The included teeth had also keratinized gingiva \ 3 mm; taking medications that would interfere with the wound-healing process or that contraindicate the surgical procedure;
* Pregnant or lactating women;
* Patients who underwent periodontal surgery in the study area;
* Patients with orthodontic therapy in progress were excluded.

